WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:03.230
(chanting sounds)

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.991
- Hey guys, I'm Letitia Wright.

00:00:06.991 --> 00:00:07.824
- I'm Martin Freeman.

00:00:07.824 --> 00:00:08.678
I play Everett Ross.

00:00:08.678 --> 00:00:09.551
- And I play Shuri.

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.026
We're going to do

00:00:11.026 --> 00:00:12.443
"Would you Rather."
- "Would You Rather"

00:00:12.443 --> 00:00:13.757
- One, two, three...

00:00:13.757 --> 00:00:14.858
Nah, I got it.
- Okay, go.

00:00:14.858 --> 00:00:16.094
- D'you want me to go first?

00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:16.927
- Duh.

00:00:16.927 --> 00:00:18.371
- [Freeman] Would you rather
have to wear Black Panther's

00:00:18.371 --> 00:00:20.702
suit every time you left your house--

00:00:20.702 --> 00:00:22.003
- or Iron Man's?

00:00:22.003 --> 00:00:22.836
- Ooooo.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:25.451
- Seriously?

00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:26.420
- Imma say Black Panther suit.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.504
Yeah, yeah, yeah...
- Far cooler.

00:00:27.504 --> 00:00:28.337
- For sure.

00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:29.605
- I would say Black Panther suit.

00:00:29.605 --> 00:00:31.078
- Yeah, I agree with that.
- Yeah, I'd have to go

00:00:31.078 --> 00:00:32.205
with Black Panther.
- Everything.

00:00:32.205 --> 00:00:33.135
- Panther.

00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:34.119
- Yeah, why?

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:35.222
- Because I made it.

00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:36.209
- Yeah, of course.

00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:37.042
- Why?

00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:39.281
It absorbs sound, run on walls.

00:00:39.281 --> 00:00:40.259
- Claws.
Claws!

00:00:40.259 --> 00:00:41.609
- Come on.
You got claws.

00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:44.552
- It gives a new meaning
to "talk to the hand."

00:00:44.552 --> 00:00:46.924
- [Freeman] Would you rather
have Nakia's ring blades

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:49.339
for hands or Thor's hammer for legs?

00:00:49.339 --> 00:00:51.099
- I kinda like my hands.
- Mhmm...

00:00:51.099 --> 00:00:53.023
- I think I could cope
with Thor hammer legs.

00:00:53.023 --> 00:00:53.922
- Nakia.
Nakia.

00:00:53.922 --> 00:00:55.523
Am I not Wakanda?

00:00:55.523 --> 00:00:56.792
- Thor's hammer for legs.

00:00:56.792 --> 00:00:57.625
- Really why?

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:00.419
- It's solid, it's rectangular,
and you can just like...

00:01:00.419 --> 00:01:01.252
- Yeah.

00:01:01.252 --> 00:01:02.285
- What're you gonna do with ring...ring

00:01:02.285 --> 00:01:03.969
- Ring blades, yeah, that's a good point.

00:01:03.969 --> 00:01:06.388
- I could do this...

00:01:06.388 --> 00:01:07.578
All I do--
- Which he does all day.

00:01:07.578 --> 00:01:08.727
- All I do is this...

00:01:08.727 --> 00:01:10.076
- All day.
- All day.

00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:11.004
- You can't even pick anything up.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.145
- No, that's true, like
Edward Scissorhands.

00:01:12.145 --> 00:01:13.235
- It's stupid it...yeah...

00:01:13.235 --> 00:01:14.273
- You just kill everything.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:15.949
- [Gurira] Would you
rather have to fight for

00:01:15.949 --> 00:01:18.241
the last slice of pizza against Shuri

00:01:18.241 --> 00:01:20.860
or X-Men mutant Storm?

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.048
- Storm, 'cause then I
would just get the pizza

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:23.113
and it's raining.

00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:24.196
I don't care.

00:01:25.165 --> 00:01:27.542
- Imma go with Shuri just because I think

00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:30.202
if I'm fighting Storm it
can get a little outta hand.

00:01:30.202 --> 00:01:31.265
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah...
- Know what I'm saying?

00:01:31.265 --> 00:01:33.267
Like lightning and rain...
- Yeah, yeah, yeah...

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:35.111
- The pizza'll get ruined
and it'll be no pizza left.

00:01:35.111 --> 00:01:36.092
- (makes wind effect)

00:01:36.092 --> 00:01:37.730
Okay, eat up mate...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.063
- Who has pizza, Shuri, what?

00:01:40.063 --> 00:01:42.052
- I think I would fight Storm.

00:01:42.052 --> 00:01:42.885
- Be a good fight.

00:01:42.885 --> 00:01:44.105
- Yeah, it would be a good fight.

00:01:44.105 --> 00:01:45.821
- [Jordan] Would you rather
be big-spooned by T'Challa

00:01:45.821 --> 00:01:48.973
or W'Kabi after a night
of Netflix and chillin'?

00:01:48.973 --> 00:01:50.892
(laughter)

00:01:50.892 --> 00:01:52.705
- D'you wanna be big-spooned
by T'Challa or W'Kabi?

00:01:52.705 --> 00:01:54.017
- Who made these questions?

00:01:54.017 --> 00:01:55.434
- Ayyyyyyyyyy....

00:01:57.004 --> 00:01:58.106
- Answer the question, young lady.

00:01:58.106 --> 00:01:59.251
- You know, you know...

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:01.303
(laughter)

00:02:01.303 --> 00:02:02.818
- I'm gonna go for T'Challa

00:02:02.818 --> 00:02:05.693
'cause I just know him a bit better.

00:02:05.693 --> 00:02:07.257
- T'Challa, definitely.

00:02:07.257 --> 00:02:08.204
- T'Challa...

00:02:08.204 --> 00:02:10.457
- Black Panther, sorry bro.

00:02:10.457 --> 00:02:13.322
- Kinda relieved, but kinda hurt.

00:02:13.322 --> 00:02:14.509
Is this confusing...

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:15.661
- W'Kabi has a blanket.

00:02:15.661 --> 00:02:16.494
- That's true.

00:02:16.494 --> 00:02:17.586
- Yeah, I dunno, maybe keep you warm.

00:02:17.586 --> 00:02:18.419
- Yeah, yeah...

00:02:18.419 --> 00:02:19.430
- I'm gonna go W'Kabi.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.477
- I'm easy either way.

00:02:21.477 --> 00:02:23.771
- [Gurira] Would you rather
have an indestructible car

00:02:23.771 --> 00:02:27.089
made of vibranium or an
indestructible cell phone

00:02:27.089 --> 00:02:28.848
made out of...

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.260
- Indestructible car...
- Car!

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.093
- Car.

00:02:31.093 --> 00:02:31.926
- Who cares about a cell phone?

00:02:31.926 --> 00:02:32.828
- I know, who cares?

00:02:32.828 --> 00:02:34.097
- I don't even like calls now.

00:02:34.097 --> 00:02:34.930
- I'm going with a car.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.144
- I'm going with the cell phone.

00:02:36.144 --> 00:02:37.165
- I'm gonna go with the car.

00:02:37.165 --> 00:02:38.273
- I'll go for the cell phone.

00:02:38.273 --> 00:02:40.494
I use my cell phone
more than I have a car.

00:02:40.494 --> 00:02:41.600
I don't have a car yet.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:45.080
So if it falls at any, you
know, it's indestructible.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.842
- I dropped my phone, I
literally just got my phone

00:02:46.842 --> 00:02:48.890
and I dropped it the same
day and cracked the screen

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.366
and I felt some type of way about it.

00:02:50.366 --> 00:02:52.496
The car, I don't plan
on crashing it or any...

00:02:52.496 --> 00:02:54.132
People with insurance go up, they drop me,

00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:56.057
and then I won't be able
to drive a car anyway.

00:02:56.057 --> 00:02:58.085
- [Jordan] Would you rather
find out your Uber driver

00:02:58.085 --> 00:03:00.035
