00:03:00.035 --> 00:03:01.345
- That's easy, M'Baku.

00:03:01.345 --> 00:03:02.530
- Yeah, yeah, M'Baku.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.517
- It'd be an entertaining ride.

00:03:03.517 --> 00:03:06.549
- But M'Baku would take
up most of the car space.

00:03:06.549 --> 00:03:07.952
- You'd need a lorry.

00:03:07.952 --> 00:03:10.452
- But no, but then, angry Hulk as well.

00:03:10.452 --> 00:03:11.285
- M'Baku.

00:03:11.285 --> 00:03:12.118
- Yeah.

00:03:12.118 --> 00:03:13.444
- The Hulk is...that's not pretty.

00:03:13.444 --> 00:03:15.164
- I think if it was the Hulk it would be

00:03:15.164 --> 00:03:17.141
a really short ride and I would die.

00:03:17.141 --> 00:03:20.044
- Angry Hulk, to me, has no
redeeming qualities at all.

00:03:20.044 --> 00:03:20.963
- Angry Hulk.

00:03:20.963 --> 00:03:23.609
- M'Baku will give you a
lot of falafel sandwiches.

00:03:23.609 --> 00:03:24.551
- That's a very...

00:03:24.551 --> 00:03:27.089
- And at the end he goes, "Are you done?"

00:03:27.089 --> 00:03:29.464
- M'Baku is sort of funny.
- Yes.

00:03:29.464 --> 00:03:30.896
M'Baku, yeah.

00:03:30.896 --> 00:03:33.183
- [Duke] Would you rather
consume a heart-shaped herb

00:03:33.183 --> 00:03:36.865
