00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:44.451
but is it immortality
like death becomes dirt,

00:03:44.451 --> 00:03:46.784
like, does your body
rot but you just don't?

00:03:46.784 --> 00:03:47.889
- No..
- Or is it like when...

00:03:47.889 --> 00:03:49.379
- You stay fabulous as we always were.

00:03:49.379 --> 00:03:50.648
- Okay, so like right now.

00:03:50.648 --> 00:03:52.367
- You'd be completely fabulous forever.

00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:54.089
- Yeah, I think I'm gonna
go with immortality.

00:03:54.089 --> 00:03:55.397
- I'm gonna go for superhuman strength

00:03:55.397 --> 00:03:58.385
'cause I think immorality
is ultimately unnatural..

00:03:58.385 --> 00:03:59.218
- Torture.

00:03:59.218 --> 00:04:00.393
