but I'll just be alive.

00:04:13.023 --> 00:04:14.638
- Just alive like here...

00:04:14.638 --> 00:04:15.581
- Yeah, no.

00:04:15.581 --> 00:04:16.439
- No.
- Kill me.

00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:17.272
