00:04:24.401 --> 00:04:27.139
- [Duke] Ooh, ooh, bro!

00:04:27.139 --> 00:04:27.972
- The Avengers.

00:04:27.972 --> 00:04:29.883
- Oooooh, Dora Milaje's fierce.

00:04:29.883 --> 00:04:32.215
I think I'll have more time
to live with the Avengers.

00:04:32.215 --> 00:04:33.048
- Actually, you know what,

00:04:33.048 --> 00:04:34.466
no I'd rather the Dora came after me

00:04:34.466 --> 00:04:35.737
'cause I like looking at them.

00:04:35.737 --> 00:04:38.113
- I knew you was gonna get saucy with it.

00:04:38.113 --> 00:04:39.094
- I like looking at them.

00:04:39.094 --> 00:04:39.927
- Okay.

00:04:39.927 --> 00:04:42.003
- Uh, Avengers every day of the week.

00:04:42.003 --> 00:04:45.441
I knew that black women is stress.

00:04:45.441 --> 00:04:46.941
I warned you, I...

00:04:47.981 --> 00:04:49.742
- Black Woman will find you.

00:04:49.742 --> 00:04:51.392
- They will find you
- They will find you

00:04:51.392 --> 00:04:52.582
and they will bring you down.

00:04:52.582 --> 00:04:53.415
- I've got it.

00:04:53.415 --> 00:04:54.259
I'd rather be on the Avenger's.

00:04:54.259 --> 00:04:55.092
- You are wise.

00:04:55.092 --> 00:04:56.009
- I'm wise.

00:04:59.222 --> 00:05:02.389
(funky, groovy music)

00:05:05.322 --> 00:05:06.190
- Yeah, that's it.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:08.857
Would you rather has killed it.

